2010-06-13T21:05:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9365397095680237,"text_excerpt":"I'm really surprised no one has reviewed Rodney's yet. I've been a huge fan of their snowballs since I was a little kid. I wouldn't even TRY another place's snowballs. Of course I've tried to broaden my horizon a bit. But no other place compares to Rodney's, in my opinion. Oh and I love those gummy bears!"},{"business_id":"q0R-2X5CJN8Fm24GSESuBA","review_id":"mpyZxMI7r6z1BglCTHvpzw","date":"2020-04-30T20:30:14","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9324811697006226,"text_excerpt":"Snowballs consistently good. Smooth ice and real flavors. Not sure why I think tamales aren't always the same but normally pretty good. Snowball and tamales hold the gummies. Go to spot For SB"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
